; js_of_ocaml spike — compiles the beloch evaluator to a Node-runnable JS
; bundle for the pure-rational fragment. The qqbar C stubs (FLINT/Calcium)
; can't compile to JS, so `qqbar_shim.js` provides JS stand-ins for every
; `external ml_qqbar_*` in lib/qqbar.ml that raise a recognizable OCaml
; exception instead of silently misbehaving. See lib/dune's
; (foreign_stubs (names qqbar_stubs)) for the native counterpart.
(executable
 (name beloch_web)
 (modes js)
 (libraries beloch zarith_stubs_js js_of_ocaml)
 (js_of_ocaml
  (javascript_files qqbar_shim.js)))
